cff-version: 1.2.0
title: hsds-proportions
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alapati
    given-names: Susanth
repository-code: "https://github.com/S-Alapati/hsds-proportions"
abstract: >-
  Assigns Oxford Nanopore reads to the hsdS alleles of a Type I
  restriction-modification shufflon using the 6mA recognition motif each allele
  leaves, and reports the proportion of the population carrying each. Motifs,
  spacer lengths and allele counts are configurable, so any bacterium with a
  comparable locus can be scored.
keywords:
  - nanopore
  - methylation
  - phase variation
  - restriction-modification
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
